    "t": "practice",
    "q": "A generator coil of 100 turns and area 0.020 m<sup>2</sup> rotates at 50 Hz in a field of 0.30 T. What is the rms emf?<br><br><br>A) 188 V<br>B) 21.2 V<br>C) 267 V<br>D) 94.2 V<br>E) 133 V",
    "a": "<b>E) 133 V</b><br><br><i>ω = 2π × 50 = 314</i> rad/s. Peak emf <i>= NBAω = 100 × 0.30 × 0.020 × 314 = 188</i> V. <i>ε<sub>rms</sub> = 188/√(2) = 133</i> V."
